 hover:bg-muted/40 lg:p-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-folder-tree size-5 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V6a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2.5a1 1 0 0 1-.8-.4l-.9-1.2A1 1 0 0 0 15 3h-2a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1Z"></path><path d="M20 21a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2.9a1 1 0 0 1-.88-.55l-.42-.85a1 1 0 0 0-.92-.6H13a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1Z"></path><path d="M3 5a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3"></path><path d="M3 3v13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3"></path></svg><span class="text-sm font-medium">Tree</span></a></div></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-2"><a href="/components" data-slot="button" data-variant="default" data-size="default" class="group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-transparent bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-9 gap-1.5 px-2.5 in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-md has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2 shadow-xs">See All Components</a></div></div></div></section> <section class="border-t bg-background py-12 lg:py-32"><div class="container"><div class="mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center"><h2 class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"><span class="inline-block bg-linear-to-b from-neutral-800 via-neutral-700 to-neutral-700 bg-clip-text pb-1 leading-normal text-transparent [text-shadow:0px_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]">A React UI library for every primitive</span></h2><p class="font-light text-muted-foreground lg:max-w-4xl lg:text-xl">Shadcnblocks is a React UI library built on shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS. All <!-- -->2028<!-- --> blocks and<!-- --> <!-- -->2104<!-- --> components are React components that work with Next.js, Vite, Astro and Remix, and every one of them is published for Radix UI, Base UI and React Aria. Pick the primitive library in<!-- --> <code class="font-mono text-base">components.json</code> and the shadcn CLI installs the matching build.</p><div class="mt-6 grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-6 self-stretch md:grid-cols-3 lg:mt-10"><a href="/radix-ui" class="group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-left transition-colors hover:border-foreground/20 hover:bg-accent/30"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-muted bg-background text-foreground"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11.52 24a7.68 7.68 0 0 1-7.68-7.68 7.68 7.68 0 0 1 7.68-7.68V24Zm0-24v7.68H3.84V0h7.68Zm4.8 7.68a3.84 3.84 0 1 1 0-7.68 3.84 3.84 0 0 1 0 7.68Z"></path></svg></span><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold transition-colors group-hover:text-primary">Radix UI</h3></div></div><p class="flex-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Our recommendation. Every block is authored against the Radix UI wrappers first, so this is the most battle-tested path and what most existing Next.js projects run.</p><code class="w-fit rounded-md border bg-muted/50 px-2 py-1 font-mono text-xs">&quot;style&quot;: &quot;<!-- -->radix-vega<!-- -->&quot;</code><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Radix UI blocks<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a href="/base-ui" class="group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-left transition-colors hover:border-foreground/20 hover:bg-accent/30"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-muted bg-background text-foreground"><svg viewBox="0 0 17 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5"><path d="M9.5001 7.01537C9.2245 6.99837 9 7.22385 9 7.49999V23C13.4183 23 17 19.4183 17 15C17 10.7497 13.6854 7.27351 9.5001 7.01537Z"></path><path d="M8 9.8V12V23C3.58172 23 0 19.0601 0 14.2V12V1C4.41828 1 8 4.93989 8 9.8Z"></path></svg></span><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold transition-colors group-hover:text-primary">Base UI</h3></div></div><p class="flex-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Headless components from the MUI team, and now the shadcn/ui default for new projects. Blocks that touch primitive APIs ship a dedicated Base UI build, typechecked against the Base UI wrappers.</p><code class="w-fit rounded-md border bg-muted/50 px-2 py-1 font-mono text-xs">&quot;style&quot;: &quot;<!-- -->base-vega<!-- -->&quot;</code><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Base UI blocks<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a href="/react-aria" class="group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-left transition-colors hover:border-foreground/20 hover:bg-accent/30"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-muted bg-background text-foreground"><svg viewBox="-36 -36 580 574" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5"><path d="M330.625-.003c93.29 0 168.916 75.678 168.917 169.033 0 75.459-49.413 139.366-117.624 161.096l112.945 141.408c9.605 12.025 1.049 29.831-14.336 29.831H378.214a36.694 36.694 0 0 1-27.863-12.822l-34.524-40.288-129.692-163.964c-22.855-28.895-2.291-71.431 34.535-71.432l109.955-.004c24.186 0 43.793-19.622 43.793-43.825 0-24.203-19.607-43.824-43.793-43.824H146.011c-15.865 0-26.235-7.086-35.525-18.691l-61.37-76.67C39.494 17.82 48.047-.004 63.44-.004h267.185ZM124.844 327.066c7.108-9.722 21.487-10.08 29.068-.723l39.011 49.215h-.654l20.817 26.636c7.941 9.801 9.128 24.31 1.574 34.413l-38.995 50.489a36.697 36.697 0 0 1-29.042 14.269H26.845c-15.3 0-23.883-17.635-14.448-29.69l75.228-96.117h-.044l37.263-48.492Z"></path></svg></span><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold transition-colors group-hover:text-primary">React Aria</h3><span title="React Aria support is in beta: shadcn&#x27;s React Aria preset is missing a few wrappers, so shadcnblocks ships its own. Blocks work, but expect small changes." class="inline-flex h-4 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 px-1.5 text-[10px] leading-none font-medium tracking-wide text-amber-700 uppercase dark:text-amber-400">Beta</span></div></div><p class="flex-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Adobe&#x27;s accessibility-first React Aria Components. Every block resolves for React Aria; where shadcn&#x27;s preset is missing a wrapper we ship our own, which is why this one is still in beta.</p><code class="w-fit rounded-md border bg-muted/50 px-2 py-1 font-mono text-xs">&quot;style&quot;: &quot;<!-- -->aria-vega<!-- -->&quot;</code><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-foreground">React Aria blocks<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">One block id, three builds.<!-- --> <a href="/docs/primitive-libraries/overview" class="font-medium text-foreground underline underline-offset-4">How the registry picks a library</a></p></div></div></section> <section class="border-t bg-background py-12 lg:py-32"><div class="container"><div class="mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center"><h2 class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"><span class="inline-block bg-linear-to-b from-neutral-800 via-neutral-700 to-neutral-700 bg-clip-text pb-1 leading-normal text-transparent [text-shadow:0px_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]">14<!-- --> Shadcn Themes</span></h2><p class="font-light text-muted-foreground lg:max-w-4xl lg:text-xl">Apply any theme to every block, component, and page with official CSS variables—light &amp; dark mode, custom fonts, and one-line CLI install.</p></div><div class="mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border"><div class="md:*:nth-child(2n):border-r-0 lg:*:nth-child(2n):border-r lg:*:nth-child(4n):border-r-0 grid grid-cols-1 *:border-b *:border-dotted *:border-border/40 max-md:*:last:border-b-0 md:grid-cols-2 md:*:border-r lg:grid-cols-4"><a href="/theme/default" class="group flex w-full flex-row 